    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984440/extras/93f51fd07ec521f5e6005a2c9d90089f.poster.avif?t=1736789592\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984440/extras/93f51fd07ec521f5e6005a2c9d90089f.webm?t=1736789592\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984440/extras/93f51fd07ec521f5e6005a2c9d90089f.mp4?t=1736789592\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Disastory is a choice-driven roleplaying adventure filled with bad dad jokes and one dimensional characters that just wont shut up! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a fantastic industrial city and its surroundings full of wacky characters and ridiculous adventures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984440/extras/63c0cd2a1b984b47e3f8c6fdfa4e59da.avif?t=1736789592\" /></div>Will you: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Stop killing, start slaying? (Time to make a <span class=\"bb_strike\">killing</span> slaying!) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Crush on the cute coffee machine? (There is a latte to love!) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Kill priests for some rad glam? (Last but not priest...) </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It's all up to you in this refreshing choice-driven adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984440/extras/a41b7bc502f53704970809c3a9759a8e.poster.avif?t=1736789592\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984440/extras/a41b7bc502f53704970809c3a9759a8e.webm?t=1736789592\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984440/extras/a41b7bc502f53704970809c3a9759a8e.mp4?t=1736789592\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984440/extras/3f40a8a1712c217cbfd446e35772d7a4.poster.avif?t=1736789592\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984440/extras/3f40a8a1712c217cbfd446e35772d7a4.webm?t=1736789592\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984440/extras/3f40a8a1712c217cbfd446e35772d7a4.mp4?t=1736789592\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Make thousands of unique (terrible) choices!  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Experience real consequences for your (dumb-ass) actions! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Decorate your home! (dead bodies included) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Go to jail! (we're not saying you'll end up there, but you know how things go...) </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984440/extras/aad1ec3553c3fe0aadcb121aba513d89.avif?t=1736789592\" /></div>Disastory features different mechanics for you to develop and level up your characters! Those changes will also be reflected visually!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> 6 unique playable characters. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Many different traits that will visually change your characters. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984440/extras/10f6342d68157b83e5df2dd5ff149211.poster.avif?t=1736789592\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984440/extras/10f6342d68157b83e5df2dd5ff149211.webm?t=1736789592\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984440/extras/93f51fd07ec521f5e6005a2c9d90089f.poster.avif?t=1736789592\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984440/extras/93f51fd07ec521f5e6005a2c9d90089f.webm?t=1736789592\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984440/extras/93f51fd07ec521f5e6005a2c9d90089f.mp4?t=1736789592\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Disastory is a choice-driven roleplaying adventure filled with bad dad jokes and one dimensional characters that just wont shut up! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a fantastic industrial city and its surroundings full of wacky characters and ridiculous adventures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984440/extras/63c0cd2a1b984b47e3f8c6fdfa4e59da.avif?t=1736789592\" /></div>Will you: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Stop killing, start slaying? (Time to make a <span class=\"bb_strike\">killing</span> slaying!) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Crush on the cute coffee machine? (There is a latte to love!) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Kill priests for some rad glam? (Last but not priest...) </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It's all up to you in this refreshing choice-driven adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984440/extras/a41b7bc502f53704970809c3a9759a8e.poster.avif?t=1736789592\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984440/extras/a41b7bc502f53704970809c3a9759a8e.webm?t=1736789592\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984440/extras/a41b7bc502f53704970809c3a9759a8e.mp4?t=1736789592\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984440/extras/3f40a8a1712c217cbfd446e35772d7a4.poster.avif?t=1736789592\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984440/extras/3f40a8a1712c217cbfd446e35772d7a4.webm?t=1736789592\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984440/extras/3f40a8a1712c217cbfd446e35772d7a4.mp4?t=1736789592\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Make thousands of unique (terrible) choices!  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Experience real consequences for your (dumb-ass) actions! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Decorate your home! (dead bodies included) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Go to jail! (we're not saying you'll end up there, but you know how things go...) </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984440/extras/aad1ec3553c3fe0aadcb121aba513d89.avif?t=1736789592\" /></div>Disastory features different mechanics for you to develop and level up your characters! Those changes will also be reflected visually!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> 6 unique playable characters. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Many different traits that will visually change your characters. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984440/extras/10f6342d68157b83e5df2dd5ff149211.poster.avif?t=1736789592\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984440/extras/10f6342d68157b83e5df2dd5ff149211.webm?t=1736789592\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p>",
